{"seq":14,"slug":"reinforcement-learning","title":"强化学习","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3}},"introMarkdown":"# 强化学习 简介\n\n强化学习是机器学习的三大范式之一，研究智能体如何在与环境的交互中通过试错学习最优行为策略。与监督学习依赖标注数据、无监督学习挖掘数据结构不同，强化学习的核心在于智能体通过不断尝试动作、观察环境反馈的奖励信号，逐步学会在复杂决策场景中做出最优选择。从 AlphaGo 击败围棋世界冠军，到 ChatGPT 背后的人类反馈强化学习（RLHF），再到 o1、DeepSeek-R1 类推理模型与智能体（Agent）的后训练，一个日益清晰的行业事实是：前沿模型的能力边界越来越由强化学习决定。本系列面向具有一定机器学习基础的中高级开发者，帮助读者系统掌握强化学习从基础理论到前沿应用的完整知识体系。\n\n第1章**强化学习基础**从问题建模出发，介绍马尔可夫决策过程、奖励设计与探索-利用权衡等核心概念，为后续章节奠定数学基础。第2章**基于值的方法**深入讲解动态规划、蒙特卡洛方法、时序差分学习以及经典的 Q-learning 与 SARSA 算法，展示如何通过估计价值函数求解最优策略。第3章**基于策略的方法**转向直接优化策略的思路，涵盖策略梯度、Actor-Critic 架构、PPO/TRPO 以及 Soft Actor-Critic 等现代算法。第4章**深度强化学习**将深度神经网络与强化学习结合，探讨 DQN 及其变体、连续控制、基于模型的方法和离线强化学习。第5章**多智能体强化学习**拓展到多个智能体协作与竞争的场景，讨论合作、对抗以及涌现行为等前沿话题。第6章**强化学习应用**展示强化学习在游戏 AI、机器人控制、RLHF 与自主决策等领域的实际落地，并系统交代 2024 年以来大模型强化学习的范式迁移：可验证奖励（RLVR）、GRPO 系策略优化、过程奖励模型与 Agentic RL。\n\n推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。如果读者已熟悉基础概念，可以直接从第3章或第4章开始深入算法细节；对应用场景更感兴趣的读者可以先浏览第6章了解全景，再回到理论章节补充细节。无论选择哪种路径，建议动手实验：经典控制任务推荐使用 **Gymnasium**——它是 Farama Foundation 维护的标准环境接口（原 OpenAI Gym 已停止维护，官方建议迁移至 Gymnasium）；LLM 训练方向可关注 veRL、TRL、OpenRLHF 等开源框架的示例，将理论与实践紧密结合。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [世界模型与仿真](../32_world-models-simulation/_INTRODUCTION.md)：本 hub 第 4 章基于模型的方法（MBRL）只讲谱系概览；\"动力学模型本身怎么学、学到的模型怎么变成可进入的模拟器\"在世界模型与仿真 hub 完整展开（含 Dreamer 4 想象内训练等 2025 年进展）。\n- [深度学习](../09_deep-learning/_INTRODUCTION.md)：本 hub 假设读者已掌握神经网络基础（反向传播、优化器、函数近似）；网络结构与训练细节在深度学习 hub 展开。\n- [LLM 基础](../02_llm-fundamentals/_INTRODUCTION.md)：第 6 章 LLM 后训练相关内容以预训练与 Transformer 基础为前提；语言模型本身的架构与训练在 LLM 基础 hub 完整讲解。\n- [RLHF 与偏好对齐](../54_rlhf-preference-alignment/_INTRODUCTION.md)：本 hub 第 6 章从强化学习视角切入对齐；偏好数据构建、DPO 系变体的完整谱系在该 hub 从对齐工程视角展开。\n- [奖励建模 RLHF](../95_reward-modeling-rlhf/_INTRODUCTION.md)：奖励模型的训练细节、偏差分析与过程奖励实践在该 hub 深入；本 hub 只交代奖励信号在 RL 流水线中的位置。\n- [LLM 推理与测试时计算](../55_llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/_INTRODUCTION.md)：o1/R1 类推理模型有\"训练侧 RL\"与\"推理侧搜索/思考预算\"两个互补视角，后者在该 hub 展开。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rl-foundations","title":"强化学习基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rl-problem-formulation","title":"强化学习问题建模","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/rl-problem-formulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"markov-decision-process","title":"马尔可夫决策过程","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/markov-decision-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reward-design","title":"奖励设计","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/reward-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"exploration-exploitation","title":"探索与利用","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-foundations/exploration-exploitation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-based-methods","title":"基于值的方法","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dynamic-programming","title":"动态规划","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods/dynamic-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-methods","title":"蒙特卡洛方法","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods/monte-carlo-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"temporal-difference","title":"时序差分学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods/temporal-difference"},{"seq":4,"slug":"q-learning-sarsa","title":"Q-learning 与 SARSA","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/value-based-methods/q-learning-sarsa"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-based-methods","title":"基于策略的方法","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-gradient","title":"策略梯度","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/policy-gradient"},{"seq":2,"slug":"actor-critic","title":"Actor-Critic 架构","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/actor-critic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ppo-and-trpo","title":"PPO 与 TRPO","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/ppo-and-trpo"},{"seq":4,"slug":"soft-actor-critic","title":"Soft Actor-Critic 柔性演员-评论家算法","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/policy-based-methods/soft-actor-critic"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"deep-reinforcement-learning","title":"深度强化学习","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dqn-and-variants","title":"DQN 及其变体","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning/dqn-and-variants"},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuous-control","title":"连续控制","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning/continuous-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"model-based-rl","title":"基于模型的强化学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning/model-based-rl"},{"seq":4,"slug":"offline-rl","title":"离线强化学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/deep-reinforcement-learning/offline-rl"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"multi-agent-rl","title":"多智能体强化学习","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"marl-foundations","title":"MARL 基础","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/marl-foundations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cooperative-rl","title":"合作强化学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/cooperative-rl"},{"seq":3,"slug":"competitive-rl","title":"竞争强化学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/competitive-rl"},{"seq":4,"slug":"emergent-behavior","title":"涌现行为","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/emergent-behavior"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"rl-applications","title":"强化学习应用","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-ai","title":"游戏 AI","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-applications/game-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"robotics-control","title":"机器人控制","url":"/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/rl-applications/robotics-control